      "rationale": "A genuine service-theme axis useful for comparing positive vs negative reviews. Values are mostly well-grounded (friendly, professional, not_present correctly applied). However YLP-0003 says 'Service was good' yet the value 'prompt' asserts a specificity not in the text, a minor unwarranted inference."
